abl-temprec|idpv1MainLoop=First(IDPtoQDP[Apply = CONSTONLY]:RunDefaultStrategyForObligation, First(Solve(Timer(12000, idpFast)), Any(Solve(idpSlow), Solve(IDPtoIRS[TempFilter=True, Time=10000, Strategy="idpIRSRuleRemoval"]:Maybe(idpGraphOp):idpv1), Solve(IDPtoQDP[Ints=REMOVE, TempFilter=True, Time=10000, Strategy="idpQDPRuleRemoval"]:Maybe(idpGraphOp):idpv1), Solve(IDPtoQDP[Apply = ALWAYSFILTER]:RunDefaultStrategyForObligation))))
